<title>GREECE: GREEK CENTRAL GOVT BUDGET FIGURES 1995-1997.</title>
<headline>GREEK CENTRAL GOVT BUDGET FIGURES 1995-1997.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following central government</p>
<p>budget figures were in the 1997 budget presented by National</p>
<p>Economy Minister Yannos Papandoniou at a news conference.</p>
<p>					   1995   1996(est)  1997(forec)</p>
<p>						   (% OF GDP)</p>
<p>  EXPENDITURES			  37.3   36.7	 36.4</p>
<p>  REVENUES				26.7   27.4	 29.2</p>
<p>  CENTRAL GOVT BUDGET DEFICIT     10.5    9.3	  6.2</p>
<p>  CENTRAL GOVT PRIMARY SURPLUS     2.2    2.4	  4.5</p>
<p>Central government total expenditures have been calculated</p>
<p>by Reuters by adding central government primary expenditures to</p>
<p>interest payments.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
